{"sections":[{"slug":"Cartan子代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Cartan子代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Cartan 子代数”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Lie代数","text":"Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数为满足如下条件的子代数</span> $\\mathfrak h\\leq \\mathfrak g$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幂零Lie代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幂零</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathfrak h$ <span lang=\"zh\">的正规化子是自身</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">紧</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数对应</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/极大环面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">极大环面</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">三角分解</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span> $\\mathfrak h$, <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/三角分解","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">三角分解</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak g = \\mathfrak n_- \\oplus \\mathfrak h \\oplus \\mathfrak n_+.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/泛包络代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">泛包络代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">具有</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">线性空间</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span>\n$$\r\nU\\mathfrak g\\simeq U\\mathfrak n_- \\otimes U\\mathfrak h\\otimes U\\mathfrak n_+.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">固定</span> Cartan <span lang=\"zh\">子代数以及</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子代数","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子代数</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathfrak h\\subset \\mathfrak b \\subset \\mathfrak g\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">相当于固定</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/根系","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">根</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">以及其中的正根系</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\mathfrak b = \\mathfrak h\\oplus \\mathfrak n$, $\\mathfrak n=[\\mathfrak b,\\mathfrak b]$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">权</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathfrak g$ <span lang=\"zh\">的表示</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $\\lambda\\in \\mathfrak h^*$, <span lang=\"zh\">定义权空间</span> (weight space)\n$$\r\nM_\\lambda = \\{m\\in M: hm=\\lambda(h)m\\forall h\\in\\mathfrak h\\}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">等于所有</span> $M_\\lambda$ <span lang=\"zh\">的直和</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则称其为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/权模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">权模</span>"}},{"Plain":" (weight module).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/半单Lie代数的表示","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">半单</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的表示</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}